AUTHOR'S BIO

Avyaan Mishra is an 11-year-old inventor, programmer, and author from India. He enjoys creating original worlds, characters, technologies, and open-source projects that combine imagination with real engineering ideas.

Vonne Pack is one of Avyaan's original story universes, featuring the VONS species, sibling bonds, adventure, science, and mystery. Along with writing stories, he also designs software, AI tools, operating system concepts, hardware ideas, and technical specifications.

Some of his projects include AVYLO, Dvidvar ISA, Dvi-Coder.web, Dob-VCS, Doton OS, Dormals AI Companion, DOARCE, DULO, and several other open-source creations.

Avyaan believes that creativity grows when stories, technology, and learning come together, and he hopes Vonne Pack inspires young readers to imagine, explore, and build new ideas of their own.

